.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH ckman-oath 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-oath \- Manage the OATH application
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-oath\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage the OATH application
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ckman\-oath\-info(1)
Display general status of the OATH application
.TP
ckman\-oath\-reset(1)
Delete all OATH accounts and the OATH password
.TP
ckman\-oath\-serial(1)
Print the device serial as answered by the OATH applet
.TP
ckman\-oath\-challenge\-response(1)
Compute an HMAC\-SHA1 challenge\-response from a PASS slot
.TP
ckman\-oath\-access(1)
Manage password protection for OATH
.TP
ckman\-oath\-accounts(1)
Manage and use OATH accounts
.TP
ckman\-oath\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
